---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Marietta County Childcare | Marietta Childcare";
const description = "Extended childcare service throughout Marietta County with county-wide coverage and regional expertise.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="min-h-screen">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-50 to-blue-50 py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Marietta County Childcare</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-6">
          Marietta County Childcare extends our service throughout the county. Marietta County coverage provides regional expertise and access to quality childcare. Marietta County families benefit from our county-wide commitment to quality care.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-700">Schedule a Tour</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Serving Marietta County Families</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Marietta County Childcare demonstrates our commitment to serving families throughout the county. Marietta County families benefit from our regional expertise and county-wide presence. Marietta County coverage ensures quality childcare is accessible across the region.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Regional Expertise in Marietta County enables Marietta Childcare to understand diverse community needs and provide comprehensive support. Regional Expertise supports families by providing information about county services, schools, and community resources.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Marietta County Community</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Marietta County Community includes diverse families seeking quality childcare throughout the region. Marietta County encompasses multiple neighborhoods and communities. Marietta County location provides access to county-wide services and resources.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Community Connection at Marietta Childcare means we're invested in Marietta County. Community Connection includes partnerships with county organizations, participation in regional events, and support for county-wide initiatives.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Why Choose Marietta County Childcare</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">County-Wide Coverage</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Comprehensive service throughout Marietta County region.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Regional Expertise</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Deep knowledge of Marietta County communities and resources.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">County Partnerships</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Strong partnerships with county organizations and schools.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Family Testimonials</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Trusted by families throughout Marietta County.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-8 mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Experience Marietta County Childcare</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Marietta Childcare's county-wide service demonstrates our commitment to families throughout Marietta County. Our educators provide quality care with regional expertise and county-wide knowledge.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-700">Schedule a Tour</a>
            <a href="/service-areas" class="inline-block bg-white text-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold border-2 border-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50">View All Service Areas</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "Marietta Childcare - Marietta County",
      "areaServed": "Marietta County, Georgia"
    }
    </script>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
